{
    "title": "Solitaire Classic Card",
    "description": "Solitaire Classic\u00a0Card is a\u00a0solitaire game for all cards game fans. This\u00a0Solitaire is very close to PC Solitaire but optimized graphics and difficulty.\r\nAs you know,\u00a0spider solitaire, freecell solitaire, pyramid solitaire\u00a0and\u00a0patience\u00a0are\u00a0popular cards game all around the world. But this Solitaire\u00a0Classic Card\u00a0Game is more interesting, challenging and classic.\r\nPlaying Solitaire helps you relax and get rid of upset.\r\nSolitaire Classic\u00a0Card is a simple solitaire classic card game for all ages. \r\nIt is an offline game which you can play with your family and friends anytime and anywhere.\r\nAlso there are Very Big and Easy-to-see cards and many different themes for you to choose. \r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Classic free solitaire card game rules\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Extremely smooth operation experience\r\n\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Complete Daily Challenge to collect trophies\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Play Right or Left-handed and adjust Draw Option to1 \r\n Card or 3 Cards\r\n\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Very Big and Clear card size\r\n\u2666\ufe0f You can play games anytime, anywhere, without network support\r\n\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Intelligent hints\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Unlimited hints and Undos\r\n\r\nHope you can enjoy playing our new Solitaire Classic Card game. Share and play this classic solitaire with your friends now.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8cYour feedback matters a lot to us! If you have any question, please email us to: puzzlegamesmaker@outlook.com\ud83d\udc8c",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solitaire Classic\u00a0Card is a\u00a0solitaire game for all cards game fans. This\u00a0Solitaire is very close to PC Solitaire but optimized graphics and difficulty.<br>As you know,\u00a0spider solitaire, freecell solitaire, pyramid solitaire\u00a0and\u00a0patience\u00a0are\u00a0popular cards game all around the world. But this Solitaire\u00a0Classic Card\u00a0Game is more interesting, challenging and classic.<br>Playing Solitaire helps you relax and get rid of upset.<br>Solitaire Classic\u00a0Card is a simple solitaire classic card game for all ages. <br>It is an offline game which you can play with your family and friends anytime and anywhere.<br>Also there are Very Big and Easy-to-see cards and many different themes for you to choose. <br><br>Game Features:<br>\u2665\ufe0f Classic free solitaire card game rules<br>\u2665\ufe0f Extremely smooth operation experience<br><br>\u2660\ufe0f Complete Daily Challenge to collect trophies<br>\u2660\ufe0f Play Right or Left-handed and adjust Draw Option to1 <br> Card or 3 Cards<br><br>\u2666\ufe0f Very Big and Clear card size<br>\u2666\ufe0f You can play games anytime, anywhere, without network support<br><br>\u2663\ufe0f Intelligent hints<br>\u2663\ufe0f Unlimited hints and Undos<br><br>Hope you can enjoy playing our new Solitaire Classic Card game. Share and play this classic solitaire with your friends now.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8cYour feedback matters a lot to us! If you have any question, please email us to: puzzlegamesmaker@outlook.com\ud83d\udc8c",
